"StayJustIn is tracking the Del Norte park fee and where the money may ultimately be spent.";

<MainLayout
title={title}
description={description}
canonical="https://www.stayjustin.com/development/del-norte-park-fee/"

«»

  <ArticleStyles />  <section class="article-page">
    <div class="container article-container">  <p class="page-kicker">Development Watch</p>

  <h1>Where Does the $961,350 Del Norte Park Fee Go?</h1>

  <p class="article-dek">
    One of the biggest unanswered questions surrounding the Del Norte project
    is how the project's park fees will ultimately be used.
  </p>

  <p><strong>Status:</strong> Developing Story</p>

  <h2>What We Know So Far</h2>

  <ul class="check-list">
    <li>$961,350 park fee required</li>
    <li>1.45 acres of park land dedicated</li>
    <li>Additional field improvements required</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Questions Residents Are Asking</h2>

  <ul class="question-list">
    <li>Will the money stay at Del Norte Park?</li>
    <li>Will Little League facilities benefit?</li>
    <li>Will the money enter a citywide fund?</li>
    <li>Who decides how it is spent?</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    StayJustIn is tracking future council discussions and budget decisions
    related to park fee spending.
  </p>

  <hr />

  <p><em>Full investigation coming soon.</em></p>

</div>

  </section>
</MainLayout>
